damn it what's wrong the decoration for my cross guard fell off why'd you have to be so rough with

5
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:58,500
it i didn't mean to break it that's not your fault it's been loose for a while now i tried tying it

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:06,680
on with string and gluing it but nothing worked oh well did it have some special purpose nope not

7
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:16,160
really it was a memento wasn't it memento yeah i guess in a way it was three years ago my sister

8
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:20,820
and i were new adventurers to learn the ropes of the dungeon we joined a group of gold strippers

9
